36
00:04:19,108 --> 00:04:23,908
[Host] It means to be born — used for people, and also for new things like a city.

37
00:04:24,507 --> 00:04:32,331
[Slow] 東京の多くの公立学校は、この日、お休みになります。

38
00:04:33,132 --> 00:04:36,708
[Host] Many public schools in Tokyo have the day off on this day.

39
00:04:37,307 --> 00:04:39,636
[Vocab] お休み

40
00:04:40,036 --> 00:04:44,836
[Host] It means a day off or holiday — a day with no school or work.

41
00:04:45,435 --> 00:04:55,444
[Slow] 予約はいりません。秋の一日、動物園や庭園に行ってみませんか。

42
00:04:56,244 --> 00:05:01,524
[Host] No reservation is needed. Why not spend an autumn day at a zoo or a garden?

43
00:05:02,124 --> 00:05:04,403
