00:06:40,528 --> 00:06:44,560
[Host] Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

56
00:06:45,160 --> 00:06:50,271
[Slow] 10月1日は、何の日ですか。

57
00:06:51,072 --> 00:06:56,639
[Host] It is Tokyo Citizens Day — a special anniversary day for the city of Tokyo.

